# Hooks and installers are executed by POSIX shells from Windows-mounted
# worktrees as well as native Linux checkouts. Keep their working-tree form LF.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Packaged provider fixtures are byte-level public contracts. Preserve their
# canonical JSON LF framing even when the checkout enables core.autocrlf.
bin/src/anvil/_data/contracts/provider-reads/v1/*.json text eol=lf
